<view class="container">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-title">杭州房产估值计算器</view>
    <view class="hero-sub">基于三把尺子的多维度参考工具</view>
    <view class="hero-tip">数据由您自行输入，本地计算，不采集隐私</view>
  </view>

  <view class="feature-list">
    <view class="feature-item">
      <view class="feature-icon">📊</view>
      <view class="feature-text">
        <view class="feature-title">三把尺子评估</view>
        <view class="feature-desc">市场比较法 / 租金回报法 / 建安成本法</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="feature-item">
      <view class="feature-icon">🏫</view>
      <view class="feature-text">
        <view class="feature-title">配套评分系统</view>
        <view class="feature-desc">交通 / 教育 / 商业 / 医疗 / 自然五维评分</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="feature-item">
      <view class="feature-icon">⚠️</view>
      <view class="feature-text">
        <view class="feature-title">不利因素检测</view>
        <view class="feature-desc">12种硬伤因素自动识别与价值修正</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="btn-primary" bindtap="goToInput">开始测算</view>

  <view wx:if="{{hasCache}}" class="cache-card" bindtap="goToResult">
    <view class="cache-label">上次测算</view>
    <view class="cache-value">{{cacheSummary}}</view>
    <view class="cache-action">查看结果 ></view>
  </view>

  <view class="nav-grid">
    <view class="nav-item" bindtap="goToHistory">
      <view class="nav-icon">📋</view>
      <view class="nav-label">历史记录</view>
    </view>
    <view class="nav-item" bindtap="goToDefects">
      <view class="nav-icon">🔍</view>
      <view class="nav-label">硬伤名录</view>
    </view>
    <view class="nav-item" bindtap="goToAbout">
      <view class="nav-icon">ℹ️</view>
      <view class="nav-label">关于</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="disclaimer">
    本工具仅供参考，不构成任何投资建议、房产评估报告或交易依据。实际交易请以专业评估和市场行情为准。
  </view>
</view>
